    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR4k0061-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-h.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">First Chapter</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-h.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">Virgin Descends the Mountain After Receiving Sword Techniques</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-h.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">Master Yuán Returns to His Cave After Stealing the Dharma Books</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-h.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">Creation and transformation are inherently limitless,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-h.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">But all that contains sentiment belongs to one family.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p001.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">If you don't believe that spirits can transform,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p001.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">A whirlwind can blow down a living lamp flower.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">It is said that during the Kāiyuán era of the Great Táng Dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">in the Zhènzé region,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">there was an official named Liú Zhíqīng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">who had served as a Remonstrance Official,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:12.9+09:00">but after submitting a memorial impeaching the Prime Minister Lǐ Línfǔ and failing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">He resigned from his post and stayed at home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">The wife had once advised her husband not to be so talkative,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">but now she couldn't help but retort a few times.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">That official was an upright man,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">how could he submit to such treatment?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">Because of this, there were back-and-forths in their speech,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">the wife felt unhappy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">and developed an illness.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">She invited a doctor for treatment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">but her condition was sometimes good, sometimes bad,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p002.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">and she couldn't fully recover.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">One day at night,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">the wife sat on the bed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">and ate a few mouthfuls of rice porridge.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">She told her nursemaid to take away the porridge bowl.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">She only saw the silver lamp was dim,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">the nursemaid said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">"Madam,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">congratulations, a big lamp flower!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">The wife said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">"What good news do I have?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">Just trim it for me,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">so that my eyes are clear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">and my heart feels refreshed."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">The nursemaid went forward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">and using two fingers, picked up the lamp pick and trimmed it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">the red flame fell down,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:16:41.191+09:00">suddenly the lamp light became bright,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Fell onto the table.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Immediately behind the lamp, a gust of cold wind arose,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">causing the lamp flame to spin left and right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">like a fiery bead.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Yǎngniáng laughed:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">"Fūrén is so playful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">the lamp flame has come to life!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Before she finished speaking,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">she saw the lamp flame spin three or four times,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">spinning to become as large as a bowl,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">a ball rolled to the ground,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">with a "huā" sound,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">like the sound of a firecracker.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">The lamp flame burst open,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">scattering sparks all over the ground,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">and instantly disappeared.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Then a three-foot-long old woman appeared,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">facing the Fūrén and offering blessings:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">"This old woman heard of Fūrén's illness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">and has brought some immortal medicine here for Fūrén to take."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">At first, the Fūrén was frightened,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">but hearing her speak these words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">she took her for a manifestation of a deity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">and instead became delighted.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">Truly, medicine can cure diseases that are not fated to cause death,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">and the Buddha helps those with affinity.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">She took the medicine then and there,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:17:28.834+09:00">and although her illness was cured,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Later, this old woman actually became entangled with the Madame,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">wanting to establish familial relations.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">She would arrive in a four-man sedan chair,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">with people shouting and crowding before and behind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">frequently coming to the house to make a commotion.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">If you tried to send her away, she wouldn't leave,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and you couldn't treat her disrespectfully.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">If anyone contradicted her with even a single word,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">she would wave her hand,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and that person would immediately fall to the ground.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">No one knew what kind of magic this was,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">but a bloody heart and liver,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">would already be held in her hand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Only after everyone begged her bitterly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">would she throw the heart and liver into the air,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and it would naturally slip into the dead person's mouth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p003.s62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and that dead person would be revived.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Because of this terrifying thing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Liú Jiànyì's entire family was troubled,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and they secretly sent people to track down her dwelling place.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">They saw her dive into the bottom of Yīngdòu Lake.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Think about it, what kind of water is Yīngdòu Lake?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">How could one establish a home at the bottom of that water?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">She must be a monster!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">They repeatedly invited Dharma masters to write talismans and chant incantations,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">but all failed to subdue her,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">and instead suffered losses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T11:18:18.795+09:00">Only when the old monk of Nánlín Temple invited a Jiēdì Honorable God,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">They set up an inescapable net,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">dispatched divine generals to capture it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">revealing its true form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">which was a three-foot-long macaque monkey that had been causing trouble for many years.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">That *Jiédì* was named *Lóngshù Wáng Púsà*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">*Liú Jiànyì* usually made offerings to this deity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">with utmost sincerity,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">so today he especially came to rescue and protect,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">to eliminate the demon and eradicate the trouble.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p004.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">A poem says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p005.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">In life, never keep a macaque monkey,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p005.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">its wild nature runs rampant and cannot be controlled;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p005.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">Don't say the lamp flower becomes a strange anomaly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p005.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">its usual behavior is enduring lewdness and theft.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">That macaque monkey resembles a human in form,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">and is extremely clever in nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">simply climbing windows, getting on tables,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">opening plates, overturning jars,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">pulling sleeves, tugging at clothes,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">scratching lice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">playing with its genitalia,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">its demeanor is extremely unrefined.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">Moreover, after many years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">how could it not cause trouble?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">There is also a larger kind,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">which is called an ape (*yuán*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">and is even more agile.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:38:10.106+09:00">Among the apes, there is also a kind with connecting arms (*tōngbì*),</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Both arms are connected,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">whichever arm he extends on that side,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">the arm on this side will retract,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">and one arm can extend out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Therefore, they are skilled at scaling cliffs and climbing trees,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">when people use arrows to shoot at them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">if it comes from the right, they catch it with the right,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">if it comes from the left, they catch it with the left,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">if it comes from close, they catch it close,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">if it comes from far, they catch it far,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">they are not afraid at all.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">There are also those who have attained enlightenment over many years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">skilled in understanding *yīnyáng*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">capable of casting spells,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">with vast supernatural powers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">too numerous to describe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">How is this seen?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p006.s32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Just see:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Born in the *Shēn* position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">descendants come from *Bā Shān*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">born in the *Shēn* position,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">the descendants of *Shēn Yáng* Guan live together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">descendants come from *Bā Shān*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">the clans of the Marquis of *Bāxī* flourish.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p007.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Soft-hearted and easily heartbroken when howling at the bright moon,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">who would not feel sorrow?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">Long arms able to reach the treetops,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:03.515+09:00">what to fear from skilled archers?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Hé chóu shàn shè? (What worries about being good at archery?)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Shùxué chuán Fēng Hòu, (Mathematics transmitted by Fēng Hòu,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">shéi zhī shì qiándài lìshī, (who knew he was a calendar master of a previous dynasty,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">dāofǎ shòu Yún Cháng, (knife techniques taught to Yún Cháng,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">cuò rèn zuò rénjiān jiànxiá, (mistakenly regarded as a swordsman among mortals,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">shéntōng què shì Xiáng Lóng zǔ, (supernatural power is actually the ancestor of Subduing Dragons,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p008.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">biànhuà píng qī Bìmǎwēn. (transformations frequently deceive Bìmǎwēn.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Huàshuō Chūnqiū Zhōu Jìngwáng shí, (It is said that during the Spring and Autumn period, during the reign of King Jìng of Zhōu,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Wú Yuè jiāozhēng, (Wú and Yuè were constantly at war,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Wú Wáng Fūchāi, (King Fūchāi of Wú,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">wéikùn Yuè Wáng Gōujiàn yú Kuàijī Shān zhī shàng, (besieged King Gōujiàn of Yuè on Mount Kuàijī,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">kuī dé xià dàfū Wén Zhǒng, (thanks to the grand master Wén Zhǒng,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">bēi cí hòulǐ qù qǐng Xíng Chéng, (who humbly and with generous gifts requested Xíng Chéng,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Wú Wáng yī yǔn, (the King of Wú agreed,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">jiāng Yuè Wáng fūfù zhāi qù guānfú, (and had the King and Queen of Yuè stripped of their crowns and robes,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">qiú yú shíshì zhī zhōng, (imprisoned in a stone chamber,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">tì Wú guó yǎng mǎ sān nián, (to raise horses for the state of Wú for three years,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">fāng shǐ fàng huí. (before they were released.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Yuè Wáng yīxīn yào bào cǐ chóu, (King Yuè was determined to avenge this humiliation,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">xiǎng Wú guó yǒu Yúcháng zhī jiàn sānqiān, (but realized the state of Wú had three thousand swords of Yúcháng,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">nányǐ dǐdí, (difficult to resist,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">yǒu shàng dàfū Fàn Lǐ xiànjì, (the senior grand master Fàn Lǐ offered a plan,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">tiāoxuǎn liùqiān jūnzǐ jūn, (to select six thousand gentlemen soldiers,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">zhāoxī xùnliàn; (and train them day and night;)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">fǎng dé Nánshān yǒu ge chǔnǚ, (he discovered that in Nánshān there was a virgin,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">jīngtōng jiànshù, (proficient in swordsmanship,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">fèng Yuè Wáng zhī mìng, (and following the King of Yuè's orders,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">pìnqǐng tā wèi guóshī. (invited her to be the national instructor.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">Nà chǔnǚ shōushi xiàshān, (That virgin packed up and descended the mountain,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">xíng dào bàntú, (traveling halfway,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">féngzhe yī ge báifǎ lǎorén, (she encountered an old man with white hair,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">zìchēng Yuán Gōng, (calling himself Yuán Gōng,)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">duì chǔnǚ shuō dào: (who said to the virgin:)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4k0061_tls_001-p009.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-21T12:47:41.078+09:00">"Wén xiǎo niángzi jīngtōng jiànshù, (I have heard that the young lady is proficient in swordsmanship,)</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>